# Copy to .env and fill in. If a key is absent here, the loader also tries
# C:\Dev\Mo_Dash\brokers\fred\.env and C:\Dev\Mo_Dash\.env.

# FRED / ALFRED (required for macro blocks)
FRED_API_KEY=

# IBKR socket (optional; per-ticker implied-vol history)
IBKR_HOST=127.0.0.1
IBKR_PORT=7496
IBKR_CLIENT_ID=17

# Where the Mo_Dash checkout lives (for the PDF drop and email helper)
MO_DASH_ROOT=C:\Dev\Mo_Dash

# Email summary (optional; falls back to Mo_Dash .env GMAIL_* keys)
GMAIL_USER=
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=
EMAIL_TO=
